  {
   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Week two starts. My pull request has comments. Now I understand the memory. I write a short note about the RAM. I ask one question about the code review. Leo tells me a story about the review comment. Leo says, \"Can you hear me?\" so I answer, \"Your voice is breaking up.\" The day is busy, but I learn a lot.",
   "tts": "Week two starts. My pull request has comments. Now I understand the memory. I write a short note about the ram. I ask one question about the code review. Leo tells me a story about the review comment. Leo says, \"Can you hear me?\" so I answer, \"Your voice is breaking up.\" The day is busy, but I learn a lot.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "第二周开始了。我的拉取请求收到了评论。现在我理解了内存。我给随机存取存储器写了一条简短的笔记。我问了一个关于代码评审的问题。Leo 给我讲了一个关于评审评论的小故事。Leo说：\"你能听见我吗？\"于是我回答：\"你的声音断断续续。\"这天很忙，但我学到了很多。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "memory",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "内存，程序运行时临时使用的快速空间"
    },
    {
     "w": "RAM",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "随机存取存储器，电脑主要的运行内存"
    },
    {
     "w": "Can you hear me?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "你能听见我吗？"
    },
    {
     "w": "Your voice is breaking up.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "你的声音断断续续。"
    },
    {
     "w": "code review",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "代码评审，由他人检查代码质量和风险"
    },
    {
     "w": "review comment",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "评审评论，针对代码提出的意见"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "I call a teammate on video. The connection is bad, but we talk. During our chat, Maria says, \"The connection is unstable.\" I answer, \"Could you turn on your camera?\" I ask one question about the storage. Leo tells me a story about the disk space. Today I approve changes for the first time. I request changes, and Maria checks it. I understand a little more than yesterday.",
   "tts": "I call a teammate on video. The connection is bad, but we talk. During our chat, Maria says, \"The connection is unstable.\" I answer, \"Could you turn on your camera?\" I ask one question about the storage. Leo tells me a story about the disk space. Today I approve changes for the first time. I request changes, and Maria checks it. I understand a little more than yesterday.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "我和一位队友视频通话。连接不好，但我们聊了很久。聊天时，Maria说：\"连接不稳定。\"我回答：\"你可以打开摄像头吗？\"我问了一个关于存储空间的问题。Leo 给我讲了一个关于磁盘空间的小故事。今天我第一次批准改动。我要求修改，Maria 来检查。我比昨天多懂了一点。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "storage",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "存储空间，长期保存文件和数据的空间"
    },
    {
