    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I finish one last task. I need to leave a comment before lunch. I resolve a conversation carefully. Leo shows me how to save to disk. I free up space one small step at a time. Leo says, \"You're on mute.\" so I answer, \"I'll call you back.\" The comments are kind. I know what to fix.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I finish one last task. I need to leave a comment before lunch. I resolve a conversation carefully. Leo shows me how to save to disk. I free up space one small step at a time. Leo says, \"You're on mute.\" so I answer, \"I'll call you back.\" The comments are kind. I know what to fix.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我完成最后一项任务。午饭前，我需要留下评论。我认真地解决对话。Leo 教我怎样保存到磁盘。我一步一步地释放空间。Leo说：\"你静音了。\"于是我回答：\"我会给你回电话。\"评论很友善。我知道该改什么了。",
